      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;padding:8px\"><a href=\"/d/nvis-hwval-powershelf?var-cluster=nvidia-lab\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"background:#1f0d0d;border:1px solid #f85149;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:64px\"><div style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1\">&#9889;</div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><div style=\"color:#ff7b72;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold\">PowerShelf Telemetry</div><div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:2px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap\">LiteOn PF-1333-13RD &middot; 24 PSUs &middot; live Redfish &middot; per-PSU Pin/Pout/Vin/Vout/Iin/Iout &middot; hotspot, fans, AC frequency, efficiency &middot; chassis aggregates</div></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#f85149;font-weight:600\">&rarr;</div></div></a><a href=\"/d/nvis-hwval-gpu-profiling\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"background:#0d2014;border:1px solid #2ea043;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:64px\"><div style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1\">&#128421;</div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><div style=\"color:#7ee787;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold\">Server Telemetry</div><div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:2px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap\">171 temps &middot; spike detection &middot; BF3 / CX8 / CPU / GPU / NVSwitch / Fan / Power &middot; SEL events &middot; serial-over-LAN history</div></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#2ea043;font-weight:600\">&rarr;</div></div></a><a href=\"/d/nvis-hwval-hw-config-mgmt\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"background:#1a1200;border:1px solid #d29922;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:64px\"><div style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1\">&#128295;</div><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><div style=\"color:#f0c040;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold\">HW Config Mgmt</div><div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:2px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap\">DGX Redfish &middot; BIOS / BMC firmware &middot; 171 temps &middot; 32 fans &middot; per-component power &middot; SEL events &middot; boot order audit</div></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#d29922;font-weight:600\">&rarr;</div></div></a></div>"
